# Unit tests (Importou)

Test entities / VOs only.

```typescript
it("should throw when cancelling an already cancelled operation", () => {
  const operation = ImportOperation.create(/* ... */);
  operation.cancel();
  const fn = () => operation.cancel();
  expect(fn).toThrow(UnprocessableEntityException);
  expect(fn).toThrow(`Cannot cancel import operation in ${ImportOperationStatus.Cancelled} status`);
});
```

- Use `Id.create("importoperation")` (or the module prefix) for ids.
- Never invent Tenant/Offer/Investment fixtures.

$END$
